      {
        "id": "b-scanner-context",
        "moduleId": "vocabulary-and-role",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "章节位置：parser 之前先设计 scanner",
        "markdown": "本节属于《A Parser for Oberon-0》一章，是该章的第一节。在开始开发 parser 之前，先要把注意力转向它的 scanner 的设计：parser 处理的是符号，而 scanner 负责把源文本变成这些符号。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
